{"seq":2,"slug":"made-to-order-production-routing-dfm","title":"按需制造工艺路由与可制造性（DFM）前置校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-customization-cpq-configurator-made-to-order/dynamic-pricing-pod-fulfillment-ops/made-to-order-production-routing-dfm","wordCount":3029,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"按需制造工艺路由与可制造性-dfm-前置校验\">按需制造工艺路由与可制造性（DFM）前置校验</h1><p>买家点下&quot;加入购物车&quot;时，配置器里存的只是一份选项组合；工厂要交付的，是一件必须被某台具体机器、某种具体材料做出来的实物。把&quot;选项组合&quot;翻译成&quot;可行的工艺路线&quot;的步骤是工艺路由（production routing）；在接单前判定&quot;这套组合是否真能造出来&quot;的步骤是可制造性前置校验（DFM pre-validation）。跨境按需制造（made-to-order / print-on-demand）的退款与重工，绝大多数不是出在加工本身，而是出在<strong>一个形式上合法、工艺上不可行的配置被放行进入了下单流程</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-路由与-dfm-的分工\">核心概念：路由与 DFM 的分工</h2><p>两个步骤容易混淆，职责却正交。<strong>工艺路由回答&quot;用哪条产线做&quot;</strong>：把配置事实映射到一组可行的&quot;工艺-工厂-批&quot;候选，产出候选集与各自的交期、成本。<strong>DFM 前置校验回答&quot;这套配置能不能做&quot;</strong>：对具体几何与参数逐条判定，产出放行、警示或阻断。依赖方向是单向的——路由的输入是&quot;规格谓词&quot;，而规格谓词由 DFM 对配置事实求值得到。三条落地纪律由此而来：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>先路由后定价</strong>：价格依赖工艺（注塑按模具摊销、CNC 按切削工时、增材按体积），定价必须在路由产出的候选上逐条计算，绝不可&quot;先定价再选工艺&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>校验分档而非一刀切</strong>：判定输出三态 <code>ok</code> / <code>warn</code> / <code>block</code>，物理不可能必须结算前拦截，风险项转化为附加费或知情确认。</li>\n<li><strong>能力表与校验规则同源</strong>：用户看到的&quot;可不可以做&quot;与工厂关心的&quot;能不能造对&quot;，必须由同一张能力表和同一套判定规则保证一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"从配置事实到工艺路线-路由的本质是能力匹配\">从配置事实到工艺路线：路由的本质是能力匹配</h2><p>给定一份配置事实（recipe——选定的材质、尺寸、几何参数、表面工艺、数量与交付约束），哪些<strong>工艺-工厂-批</strong>（process-factory-lot）三元组在物理与商业上都可行？</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>∣</mo><mtext>cap</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊨</mo><mtext>spec</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>lead</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>deadline</mtext></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>margin</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\{\\, p \\in P \\mid \\text{cap}(p) \\models \\text{spec}(r) \\;\\wedge\\; \\text{lead}(p) \\le D_{\\text{deadline}} \\;\\wedge\\; \\text{cost}(p) \\le B_{\\text{margin}} \\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">spec</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lead</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deadline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">margin</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>spec(r)</code> 是配置事实推导出的<strong>规格谓词集合</strong>（如&quot;最大外廓 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>200</mn><mtext>mm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 200\\text{mm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></span>&quot;&quot;材质属于热塑性塑料&quot;），<code>cap(p)</code> 是某台设备的<strong>能力声明</strong>。路由不是运行时现算交期，而是维护一张<strong>能力表</strong>，把物理约束、机器幅面、材料兼容矩阵、精度等级编码成可查的声明——这与配置器规则引擎同源（见 <a href=\"../constraint-rules-cpq-guided-selling/constraint-rule-engine-architecture\">约束规则引擎架构</a>），区别在于规则引擎约束&quot;用户能选什么&quot;，能力表约束&quot;工厂能做什么&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  R[配置事实 recipe] --&gt; S[派生规格谓词 spec]&#10;  S --&gt; F[能力表过滤&lt;br/&gt;几何/材料/精度]&#10;  F --&gt; C1[候选工艺 CNC]&#10;  F --&gt; C2[候选工艺 注塑]&#10;  F --&gt; C3[候选工艺 增材]&#10;  C1 --&gt; Q[逐候选报价]&#10;  C2 --&gt; Q&#10;  C3 --&gt; Q&#10;  Q --&gt; D[交期与成本排序]&#10;  D --&gt; P[可下单路线集]\">graph TD\n  R[配置事实 recipe] --&gt; S[派生规格谓词 spec]\n  S --&gt; F[能力表过滤&lt;br/&gt;几何/材料/精度]\n  F --&gt; C1[候选工艺 CNC]\n  F --&gt; C2[候选工艺 注塑]\n  F --&gt; C3[候选工艺 增材]\n  C1 --&gt; Q[逐候选报价]\n  C2 --&gt; Q\n  C3 --&gt; Q\n  Q --&gt; D[交期与成本排序]\n  D --&gt; P[可下单路线集]</pre><h2 id=\"工艺能力建模-把不可见约束写成可执行断言\">工艺能力建模：把不可见约束写成可执行断言</h2><p>能力表的价值取决于编码粒度。只写&quot;支持铝合金&quot;远远不够——真正决定可行性的是整套<strong>工艺约束参数</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工艺</th>\n<th>关键能力字段</th>\n<th>典型几何下限（工程经验值）</th>\n<th>主导成本驱动</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FDM 增材</td>\n<td>幅面、层高、挤出宽度</td>\n<td>最小壁厚 ~1.2mm、悬垂角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 45^\\circ</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 免支撑</td>\n<td>材料体积 + 支撑体积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SLS/MJF 增材</td>\n<td>成型缸尺寸、粉末粒径</td>\n<td>最小壁厚 ~0.7–1.0mm、需排粉孔</td>\n<td>包围盒体积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SLA/DLP 光固化</td>\n<td>幅面、激光光斑</td>\n<td>最小特征 ~0.2–0.4mm、需支撑</td>\n<td>高度 × 截面积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CNC 铣削</td>\n<td>行程、主轴、刀具库</td>\n<td>内圆角半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span></span></span></span></span> 刀具半径、深宽比</td>\n<td>切削工时 + 装夹次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钣金折弯</td>\n<td>折弯机吨位、模具</td>\n<td>折弯半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span></span></span></span></span> 板厚、孔到边距</td>\n<td>折弯次数 + 料面积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>激光切割</td>\n<td>幅面、激光功率</td>\n<td>割缝宽 ~0.1–0.3mm、最小孔径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span></span></span></span></span> 板厚</td>\n<td>切割周长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注塑</td>\n<td>锁模力、模具尺寸</td>\n<td>拔模角 1–2°、壁厚均匀</td>\n<td>模具摊销 + 材料</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>增材制造的七类基本工艺术语由 <strong>ISO/ASTM 52900:2021</strong>《增材制造 — 通用原则 — 术语》统一定义（材料挤出、粉末床熔融、光聚合、材料喷射、黏合剂喷射、定向能量沉积、片材层压，由 ASTM F42 委员会主持），路由系统应直接采用这套分类作为工艺枚举，避免自造词汇导致能力表无法与设备商 datasheet 对齐。未标注单位与材质的 <strong>STL</strong> 是路由的敌人：一份 STL 里的&quot;10&quot;既可能毫米也可能英寸，能力表无从判定，因此现代管线普遍转向内嵌单位与材质的 <strong>3MF</strong>（3MF Consortium 维护）或 STEP（ISO 10303）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dfm-前置校验-几何-公差与工艺规则的判定\">DFM 前置校验：几何、公差与工艺规则的判定</h2><p>DFM 把能力表里每条约束变成对具体几何或参数的<strong>判定函数</strong>，输出三态 <code>ok</code> / <code>warn</code>（可做但需溢价或提示风险）/ <code>block</code>（不可做）。判定分三层，从便宜到昂贵递进，<strong>目的是在付代价之前用便宜的检查拦住大多数问题</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>其一，参数级校验（毫秒级，客户端可做）。</strong> 只依赖离散选项与显式数值：材质与工艺是否兼容（不能对纸张做 SLS）、数量是否达到最小起订、尺寸是否落在机器幅面内。这一层不解析几何，纯查表，应在浏览器即时反馈，因为它决定用户下一步能选什么。它本质上是规则引擎在&quot;物理侧&quot;的延伸，应与&quot;用户可见选项&quot;的规则共用同一套求值内核。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，几何级校验（秒级，服务端）。</strong> 需解析 3D 网格或 2D 矢量：最小壁厚、悬垂角、最小特征尺寸、内圆角与刀具可达性、折弯半径与孔边距。增材的悬垂判定逐三角面计算<strong>法向与打印方向的夹角</strong>，超过阈值（FDM 经验值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">45^\\circ</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）即需支撑，支撑量计入报价。SLS 这类粉床工艺需要封闭腔体的<strong>排粉孔（escape hole）</strong>，否则废件，配置器几乎必然漏掉。CNC 的核心约束是<strong>刀具可达性</strong>：深宽比过大的窄槽无法加工，内直角必然留下等于刀具半径的圆角。</p>\n<p><strong>其三，公差与能力校验（依赖统计，最贵）。</strong> 装配体或配合特征需判断工艺能否达到所需公差。设计公差按**公差累积（stackup）**建模，最坏情况法保守，均方根法反映随机误差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>wc</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>rss</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{wc}} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} t_i, \\qquad T_{\\text{rss}} = \\sqrt{\\sum_{i=1}^{n} t_i^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1568em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8791em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-5.1168em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.1168em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1.056em;\"><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8391em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.1168em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.742em;height:3.1968em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"3.1968em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 3196\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M702 80H40000040\nH742v3062l-4 4-4 4c-.667.7 -2 1.5-4 2.5s-4.167 1.833-6.5 2.5-5.5 1-9.5 1\nh-12l-28-84c-16.667-52-96.667 -294.333-240-727l-212 -643 -85 170\nc-4-3.333-8.333-7.667-13 -13l-13-13l77-155 77-156c66 199.333 139 419.667\n219 661 l218 661zM702 80H400000v40H742z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>制造能力用<strong>过程能力指数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">USL</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LSL</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为规格上下限，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 为过程均值与标准差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mfrac><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk} = \\min\\!\\left(\\frac{USL - \\mu}{3\\sigma},\\; \\frac{\\mu - LSL}{3\\sigma}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用它判断&quot;某工艺能否满足该公差&quot;需能力表携带每台设备的实测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>，这远超多数 POD 平台的数据成熟度。务实做法是退一步：能力表用<strong>精度等级</strong>（如 <strong>ISO 2768</strong>《一般公差》的 f/m/c/v 四级，或设备商的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span></span></span></span></span> 值）表达，路由时把设计公差与该等级对应的默认公差比对，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 仅在自有工厂的高价值产线上启用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"校验时机-下单前拦截-vs-报价后复核\">校验时机：下单前拦截 vs 报价后复核</h2><p>校验放的位置直接决定它对退款率的影响：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时机</th>\n<th>检出成本</th>\n<th>对转化率的影响</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>配置过程中实时</td>\n<td>最低（本地/缓存）</td>\n<td>正面：引导到可行配置</td>\n<td>参数级、显式数值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加购/结算前</td>\n<td>中（服务端几何）</td>\n<td>需谨慎：误报会拦掉真实订单</td>\n<td>几何级 <code>block</code> 项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报价/接单后复核</td>\n<td>最高（人工/深度分析）</td>\n<td>负面：已承诺又反悔</td>\n<td>装配级、统计级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键原则：<strong><code>block</code> 级别的物理不可能必须在结算前拦住，<code>warn</code> 级别给用户知情权而非一律拦截</strong>。过度激进的校验器会在&quot;窄槽&quot;上把大量本可加工的订单误杀（用户其实接受高溢价），比漏检更有害——直接砍转化。因此 <code>warn</code> 应转化为<strong>附加费或明确的风险确认</strong>，这与配置器里&quot;合法性规则 vs 警示规则&quot;是同一模式。跨境场景多一层：<strong>报价一旦对外承诺就构成商业要约</strong>，事后以&quot;不可制造&quot;取消会触发平台纠纷，因此路由与 DFM 必须在<strong>生成对外报价之前</strong>完成权威复核，路线与结论冻结保存为争议证据链，且<strong>任何编辑产生新版本时路线、价格、校验结论一起重算</strong>（同 <a href=\"../visual-configurator-preview-artwork/realtime-preview-artwork-upload-pipeline\">实时预览与设计稿上传管线</a> 的版本一致纪律）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境多工厂路由-成本-交期与合规的联合约束\">跨境多工厂路由：成本、交期与合规的联合约束</h2><p>同一份配置事实往往适配多个国家的多个产能池，选择变成多目标问题：满足交期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 的前提下最小化总到岸成本（制造、运费、关税、合规处置）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>mfg</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>ship</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>duty</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>lead</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{p \\in R} \\; C_{\\text{mfg}}(p) + C_{\\text{ship}}(p) + C_{\\text{duty}}(p) \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\text{lead}(p) \\le D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6304em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mfg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ship</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">duty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lead</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>目标市场的<strong>强制性合规</strong>是硬过滤条件，且常与工艺耦合：面向欧盟需符合 <strong>CE</strong> 标志对应的指令（按品类适用机械、EMC、玩具安全等），电子类还需 <strong>RoHS</strong> 与 <strong>WEEE</strong>；面向美国消费品受 <strong>CPSIA</strong>（儿童产品含量与追溯）与 FTC 纺织/原产地标识约束；面向欧盟化学品需满足 <strong>REACH</strong>。进入能力表的方式是：为每个&quot;工厂-工艺-材料&quot;组合声明其<strong>可达成的合规证书集</strong>，路由时按订单目标市场过滤——用含铅焊料的定制电子饰品在欧盟路线上应直接 <code>block</code>，而非等清关被扣。合规证书有有效期与发证机构，必须与能力表一样版本化、可审计。</p>\n<p>路由分发还需<strong>产能与排期的实时信号</strong>：某台设备当日队列长度决定其实际可达交期。把&quot;标称交期&quot;与&quot;实时可用产能&quot;分开建模，报价用前者承诺、排产用后者调度。产能扣减应与播放一致地使用<strong>乐观锁（版本号/CAS）</strong>，而非&quot;先查后写&quot;——拼版与共享产线下，两个订单同时抢同一张 gang sheet 是高发竞态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性-失败恢复与迭代\">可观测性、失败恢复与迭代</h2><p>系统的质量要用&quot;出厂缺陷率&quot;而非&quot;通过率&quot;度量。核心指标是<strong>首次通过率（first-pass yield）</strong>（无需返工或客户沟通即完成的比例），与<strong>漏检率</strong>（放行但生产失败）和<strong>误杀率</strong>（被 <code>block</code> 但复核确认可做）配对——三者构成必须同时监控的张力：压低漏检往往抬高误杀，方向是在固定漏检上限下最小化误杀。</p>\n<p>工单一旦下发，路由决策必须<strong>幂等且可重放</strong>：输入是 <code>(recipe 版本, 能力表版本, 路由算法版本)</code>，输出确定的工艺路线与报价。当某工艺漏检率持续偏高，它是一条<strong>需要回灌到规则与能力表</strong>的信号：把人工发现的新约束（新的排粉孔需求、新的最小孔径经验值）编码进对应校验规则并 bump 能力表版本，价值不在于一次写对，而在于每次真实废件都变成一条<strong>不再重犯的约束</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>工艺路由与 DFM 校验是同一枚硬币的两面：前者把配置事实映射到可行的&quot;工艺-工厂-批&quot;候选，后者判定这份配置在物理与统计上能否造对。落地要点四条——<strong>先路由后定价</strong>、<strong>能力表带版本可审计</strong>、<strong>校验分层递进</strong>（毫秒级参数检查先行，秒级几何检查兜底，统计级能力检查只在自有高价值产线启用）、<strong>判定分档反馈</strong>（<code>block</code> 拦截、<code>warn</code> 转附加费或知情确认）。跨境场景额外叠加合规与产能两类硬约束，都需与工艺能力一起进入同一张可版本化的能力表。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"按需制造工艺路由与可制造性（DFM）前置校验","id":"按需制造工艺路由与可制造性-dfm-前置校验"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：路由与 DFM 的分工","id":"核心概念-路由与-dfm-的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"从配置事实到工艺路线：路由的本质是能力匹配","id":"从配置事实到工艺路线-路由的本质是能力匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"工艺能力建模：把不可见约束写成可执行断言","id":"工艺能力建模-把不可见约束写成可执行断言"},{"level":2,"text":"DFM 前置校验：几何、公差与工艺规则的判定","id":"dfm-前置校验-几何-公差与工艺规则的判定"},{"level":2,"text":"校验时机：下单前拦截 vs 报价后复核","id":"校验时机-下单前拦截-vs-报价后复核"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境多工厂路由：成本、交期与合规的联合约束","id":"跨境多工厂路由-成本-交期与合规的联合约束"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性、失败恢复与迭代","id":"可观测性-失败恢复与迭代"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"动态定价引擎：基础价、选项加价与阶梯/成本加成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-customization-cpq-configurator-made-to-order/dynamic-pricing-pod-fulfillment-ops/dynamic-pricing-rule-quantity-ladder"},"next":{"title":"定制订单履约异常、内容合规风控与运营度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-customization-cpq-configurator-made-to-order/dynamic-pricing-pod-fulfillment-ops/custom-order-exception-risk-compliance"}}